1
00:00:00,542 --> 00:00:03,672
(Penny:)Sweetie, can I just be the girl tonight?

2
00:00:04,079 --> 00:00:06,209
(Leonard:)Absolutely. You're the girl, I'm the guy.

3
00:00:06,849 --> 00:00:09,379
(Leonard:)Watch your football game
while I make you a plate here.

4
00:00:09,551 --> 00:00:11,021
(Amy:)Thank you.

5
00:00:13,522 --> 00:00:16,352
I'll get it. Go sports! Heh.

6
00:00:18,227 --> 00:00:20,357
Hello-Io-Io.

7
00:00:21,296 --> 00:00:23,456
(Leonard:)I thought you were out
with Sheldon and Amy.

8
00:00:23,632 --> 00:00:27,032
(Raj:)I was, but it's their anniversary,
and I didn't wanna be a third wheel...

9
00:00:27,202 --> 00:00:30,102
...so I figured I'd hang out
with you and Penny on your date.

10
00:00:30,939 --> 00:00:34,539
(Leonard:)It's not really a great time.
Penny and I have some things to talk about.

11
00:00:34,710 --> 00:00:36,140
No we don't, come on in!

12
00:00:37,046 --> 00:00:38,876
(Penny:)Sweet.

13
00:00:39,214 --> 00:00:42,154
(Amy:)I can't believe
I shaved my stomach for this.

14
00:00:47,823 --> 00:00:49,793
(Dimitri:)Hey, Froot Loops.

15
00:00:53,429 --> 00:00:55,129
(Dimitri:)You got a phone call.

16
00:00:55,531 --> 00:00:56,831
(Howard:)Who is it?

17
00:00:57,032 --> 00:01:05,022
(Dimitri:)A woman who says she's your mother
but sounds like your father.

